Usage: logname

Print the name of the current user.

Print the login name of the user that is currently logged in.
On Windows, this returns the current Windows username.

OPTIONS:
                 print user's login name
      --help     display this help and exit
  -V, --version  output version information and exit

EXIT STATUS:
  0  if OK,
  1  if minor problems,
  2  if serious trouble.

WinuxCmd is a Windows implementation of GNU CoreUtils for Linux-Windows developers and AI coding assistants.
